12.239.1 Usage
--------------

   • Turn on ‘emacsvox-comint-autospeak’ for using the shell.
   • Turn off ‘emacsvox-comint-autospeak’ when using full-screen ncurses
     apps like ‘vi’.
   • Use ‘vterm-copy-mode’ to review the contents of the terminal --
     ‘C-c C-t’.


